{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>SEND YOUNG WARDS TO SACRIFICE:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Intendant of the Corvus, your sacred duty is to prepare promising Wards for their ascending voyage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/c5587d523c9c30bef0328660aa9e5f04.poster.avif?t=1770069657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/c5587d523c9c30bef0328660aa9e5f04.webm?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/c5587d523c9c30bef0328660aa9e5f04.mp4?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Ward of the Corvus and carve your way through the interconnected islands of the Krom Archipelago to end the evil consuming this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/673c8a0eee9496bf307e7eceae0d1bf3.poster.avif?t=1770069657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/673c8a0eee9496bf307e7eceae0d1bf3.webm?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/673c8a0eee9496bf307e7eceae0d1bf3.mp4?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face formidable enemies in epic battles and uncover countless secrets with every new sacrificial attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/303f0c6e80cf68d70a39dd93f3a80db6.poster.avif?t=1770069657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/303f0c6e80cf68d70a39dd93f3a80db6.webm?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/303f0c6e80cf68d70a39dd93f3a80db6.mp4?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their ultimate purpose? To sacrifice themselves to the Gate and delay the spreading corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/7f090f29dfbf1729f689b7731d78d4f5.poster.avif?t=1770069657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/7f090f29dfbf1729f689b7731d78d4f5.webm?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/7f090f29dfbf1729f689b7731d78d4f5.mp4?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed in your mission, and you'll extract valuable resources and powerful new equipment, ensuring the next generation of Wards is even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/bfa872094d678cb329f7d208c94fdcaf.poster.avif?t=1770069657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/bfa872094d678cb329f7d208c94fdcaf.webm?t=1770069657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sha